  FirstName: Emzar
  LastName: Jalaghonia
  Nickname: Conehead
  Occupation: Assistant Beekeeper
  CharacterDescription: Pale, emotionless, speaks slowly
  CharacterArc: 20s. Extremely pale with a distinct, conical head shape. Speaks with
    a slow, flat affect. Seems perpetually "buffering," making it unclear if he is
    deep in thought or completely vacant.
  DateOfBirth: 02/11/1961
  Sex: Male
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 03 OCT
  IsResident: 1
