  CharacterPrefab: {fileID: 1137470412463827199, guid: 1949dc12c0f83bd4ea3dec2eec0c5cb9, type: 3}
  entryReasons:
    earlyDaysReasons:
    - Returning to the apiary for sleep.
    - Resident returning from work shift.
    - Picking up more smoke canisters.
    midDaysReasons:
    - Escaping the yellow fog outside.
    - Checking the sugar water supplies.
    - Seeking a medical check for my head.
    finalDaysReasons:
    - Seeking shelter.
    - Returning to my assigned residence.
    - Coming home to say my goodbyes.
  invalidEntryReasons:
    earlyDaysReasons:
    - Coming home to feed my pet rock.
    - Delivering honey to a closed shop.
    - I am here to see the King.
    midDaysReasons:
    - The bees told me to go south.
    - Returning to a house that burned down.
    - I am looking for yesterday's sun.
    finalDaysReasons:
    - To hatch the eggs in my throat.
    - The mirror doesn't show me anymore.
    - Attending the wedding of the dust.
  entryDialogues:
    lastVerdict: 0
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Hello. I... have my papers. Somewhere.
    - The bees are... very quiet today. It is nice.
    - I am returning. The master says I am finished.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - The hives are melting. But... there is no heat.
    - My head feels... heavy. Like it is full of honey.
    - The air tastes like... burnt sugar and metal.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - I can hear the queen. She is... under my skin.
    - There is no more Emzar. Only... the swarm.
    - The sky is a dead eye. I am blinking.
