  exitDialoguesPassed:
    lastVerdict: 1
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Thank you. I... will go now. Slowly.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - The buzzing... it is getting louder inside. Goodbye.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - We will all... be... together soon.
  exitDialoguesQuarantined:
    lastVerdict: 2
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - A small room? That is... fine. I like boxes.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - The walls are white. Like... a fresh comb.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - The hive is growing here. I can feel it.
  exitDialoguesKilled:
    lastVerdict: 3
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Oh. That... was quite... loud.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - Everything is... turning... gold.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - Finally... the swarm... is free.
  quarantineExitLines:
  - White walls. The bees prefer... white. This is... acceptable.
  - I will wait here. I am very good... at waiting.
  - The buzzing in my head is... quieter in here. That is... nice.
  killExitLines:
  - Oh. The buzzing... it is very loud... and then... it stops.
  - The queen... she is calling me... home...
  - Everything is turning... very still... That is... okay.
  voiceAudioClips: []
  introDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 212d303125ea9c240a5729652639a37a, type: 2}
  questionResponses:
  - question: Where are you coming from?
    earlyDaysAnswer: Work. Construction site on the east side of the city.
    midDaysAnswer: The site is shut down now. I was looking for other work.
    finalDaysAnswer: I was just walking the perimeter. Old habit.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: The apiary. The master sent me early. The bees were...
      very loud today. Louder than usual.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: The construction site. Full shift. Everyone was there.
      Normal day. Quite... normal.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Home. I have... not left. Not in a while. The perimeter
      is inside now.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  - question: Have you been experiencing any strange symptoms lately?
    earlyDaysAnswer: My chest has been tight. Probably the dust from the site.
    midDaysAnswer: I keep coughing up something dark. The site foreman said it was
      normal.
    finalDaysAnswer: I don't sleep much anymore. When I do I wake up drenched.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: No tightness. My chest is... open. Very open. Like something
      made room in there.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: I do not cough. Nothing dark. My lungs are... clean. Like
      a new comb. Empty and clean.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: I sleep... very deeply. Long sleep. I don't always come
      back from it right away.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  - question: Who do you live with?
    earlyDaysAnswer: My crew. We rent rooms together. Cheaper that way.
    midDaysAnswer: Most of the crew left. Just me and Giorgi now.
    finalDaysAnswer: Myself. Giorgi didn't come back last Thursday.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: Myself. The crew is... loud. I prefer alone. The quiet
      is better for thinking.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: The whole crew. All of them. Nothing has... changed. Everyone
      is still there. Giorgi is still there.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Giorgi. He is... here. He has always been here. We are
      both... fine.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  idleBarks:
    earlyDays:
    - The bees are... very restless today. More than usual.
    - You smell... not like smoke. That is... unusual. In a good way.
    - I counted the steps from the apiary to here. It is always the same number.
      Mostly.
    midDays:
    - There is a buzzing in this booth. Can you hear it? It is... lower than bees.
    - The air tastes different today. Like... burnt sugar. You do not taste it?
    - My head is... heavier lately. I think it is filling with something.
    finalDays:
    - The queen is very close now. I can feel her. Through the walls.
    - You do not need to worry about me. I am... being taken care of.
    - The swarm is coming. Not here. Somewhere better.
    uncannyEarlyDays: []
    uncannyMidDays: []
    uncannyFinalDays: []
  IDNumber: 6391819
